    "screen": 9,
    "path": "/onboarding/how-you-drive",
    "text": "Step 3 of 4\n\nHow do you usually drive?\n\nPick all that apply. It helps us time your break reminders.\n\nDaily commute\nShort drives, often in traffic\nLong highway trips\nBalik kampung and outstation drives\nLate nights or early mornings\nDriving when you’d normally be asleep\nRide-hailing or delivery\nMany hours on the road for work\nContinue",
    "width": 430,
